    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 14px 0;">McKinsey&#8217;s research on enterprise AI deployments keeps surfacing the same finding: <strong style="font-weight:700;">30&#8211;40% of AI project failures trace to data quality issues</strong> — not model sophistication, not compute limitations, not talent gaps. Data.</p>

