    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 16px 0;">Seven months until the SWIFT CBPR+ enforcement milestone — the point where progressive rejection rates begin for non-compliant messages. Here&#8217;s where the three regulatory bodies stand as we enter Q2 2026:</p>

