    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 20px 0;">Three independent bodies. Same conclusion. This isn&#8217;t ambiguous, and the deadline isn&#8217;t moving. The question has shifted from <em>whether</em> to comply to <em>how deeply</em> to invest in data readiness. Since implementation effort is identical whether you target structured or hybrid, there&#8217;s no rational basis for aiming at the floor.</p>

