        <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#466587;margin:0 0 12px 0;">The ISO 20022 migration is the payments industry&#8217;s best chance in thirty years to fix cross-border data quality at its source. Format compliance is the starting line — data readiness is the finish. This piece explains why, and what it takes to cross it.</p>
        <a href="https://ionova.ai/blog/iso-20022-this-time-lets-get-payments-data-right-2" style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0972D3;text-decoration:none;">Read Article &#8594;</a>
