        <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#466587;margin:0 0 12px 0;">Building in-house takes 18&#8211;36 months. Retrofitting postal tools creates a fragile integration chain that fails precisely where compliance risk is highest. Both structured and hybrid addressing require identical implementation effort through sidecar architecture — there is no cost argument for targeting hybrid alone.</p>
        <a href="https://ionova.ai/blog/structured-vs-hybrid-addresses-why-its-not-either-or" style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0972D3;text-decoration:none;">Read Article &#8594;</a>
