    <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#232F3E;margin:0 0 20px 0;">Three questions. Answer them honestly. They will tell you more about your ISO 20022 readiness than any compliance dashboard:</p>

