        <p style="font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#232F3E;margin:0;"><strong style="font-weight:700;">When a payment message says &#8220;London,&#8221; does your system know which London?</strong> There are cities named London in six countries. If your answer is &#8220;we rely on the postal code&#8221; — what happens when there is no postal code?</p>
